  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>B</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>C</mi></math> are square matrices of same order such that <math><msup><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></math> and <math><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mi>I</mi></math> is an identity matrix, then the inverse of matrix <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>C</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>I</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>I</mi></math> (as <math><msup><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math> )<br />Hence, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p>"
  }
}